String description(String p){switch(p){case "Daily Study Log":return "Track focused sessions.";case "Question Bank Log":return "Track attempts and accuracy.";case "Mock Test Analytics":return "Record scores and link mistakes.";case "Mistake Register":return "Link errors to the mock where they happened.";case "Revision Scheduler":return "Plan spaced reviews.";default:return "Set weekly targets and record actuals.";}}
